{
  "name": "Daily LinkedIn jobs to Google Sheets",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Daily LinkedIn jobs to Google Sheets\nEvery morning, searches LinkedIn for your keywords and location and adds new jobs to a sheet. Rows are matched on `jobId`, so the same job is never added twice.\n\n**Setup (2 minutes)**\n1. Create a free Apify account and copy your API token (Apify Console > Settings > API & Integrations).\n2. Add an n8n *Header Auth* credential named **Apify API token**: header `Authorization`, value `Bearer YOUR_TOKEN`.\n3. Connect Google Sheets, paste your sheet URL, and create a tab named **Jobs**.\n4. Edit the keywords in **Settings**.\n\nCost: [LinkedIn Jobs Scraper](https://apify.com/artificially/linkedin-jobs-scraper) charges $0.25 per run plus $2 per 1,000 jobs (about $10 a month for 50 jobs a day).",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 460
      },
      "id": "9e9f5ae0-6230-4ef2-8fde-935c32bd7913",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "days",
              "triggerAtHour": 8
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "1f620796-904c-4ea1-a215-7a0c7e9bb649",
      "name": "Schedule",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "cf62a676-7ce2-473b-8cf6-ad63b0c40468",
              "name": "searchQueries",
              "value": "data engineer, product manager",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "a68f6143-1084-486a-8c59-098062d7bb85",
              "name": "location",
              "value": "United States",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "648b9525-0cf1-4b25-8037-b57b71cda682",
              "name": "maxJobsPerQuery",
              "value": 50,
              "type": "number"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "e2b40d09-70cd-4fcd-a8d0-69433fb57a7b",
      "name": "Settings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/artificially~linkedin-jobs-scraper/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ searchQueries: $json.searchQueries.split(',').map(s => s.trim()).filter(Boolean), location: $json.location, maxJobs: $json.maxJobsPerQuery, datePosted: 'past-24h' }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 300000
        }
      },
      "id": "a6803128-4c81-40f0-a86a-38b6a9cbcb10",
      "name": "LinkedIn Jobs Scraper",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Apify API token"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "return $input.all().map(({ json: j }) => ({ json: {\n  jobId: j.jobId,\n  title: j.title,\n  company: j.company,\n  location: j.location,\n  posted: j.listingDateParsed || j.listingDate,\n  searchQuery: j.searchQuery,\n  url: j.jobUrl,\n} }));"
      },
      "id": "8bd294fa-c2c4-4af8-8ffc-f7157dd2e571",
      "name": "Format",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        660,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "appendOrUpdate",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "url",
          "value": ""
        },
        "sheetName": {
